 "notes": [
  "Groups: 0 the canal front on the Lijnbaansgracht (shell 3 surface 9, w03-246 2021-01-22): five fronts in a row, glazed white-framed bay stacks (bays 0 and 2: a two-storey glazed stack on storeys 1-2, three-light windows above) and loggias with grey perforated-metal rails (bays 1, 3, 4) over a raised ground with a red brick plinth; 1 the SW end (surface 28, w05-220 2022-04-29), two stacks over six storeys; 2 its lower SW wing (surface 27, same crop), one stack over the gateway; 3 the NW end (surface 2, w06-332L 2023-01-30), a stack and a punched column in brick and a glazed corner; 4 the second block's NW front on the Lijnbaansgracht (shell 2 surface 20, w07-332L 2023-01-30), a loggia, two three-storey glazed stacks and a punched column.",
  "Colours: the crops are winter or overcast; brick sampled on the lit storeys of w05-220 (#a99f98) and lifted slightly; plinth red from w05-220 (#523a36 shaded).",
  "Other walls (window grid): the set-back top storeys (no crop reaches them), the red-brick Looiersgracht wing (w01-152 2020-08-31 is 5 m away and oblique), the NE block's NE and SE walls (w02-62 at 34-44 deg; w04-153 misregistered) and the courtyard."
 ]
}